                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-30T11:00:00-05:00">March 30, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your 37, March 27, 10 a.m., paragraph 11. Please send brief cable reports on
                    developments of interest in the Leticia situation.</p>
